    "text": "By Grant Afseth ,\n1 hours ago Coby White scored 17 points and dished six assists in a 118-89 victory against the Boston Celtics on Wednesday, and Hornets coach Charles Lee had no reservations about what the newly acquired guard brings to Charlotte. \"He adds a lot to our environment and to our product on the court,\" Lee said. ... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
